# WMOOP code owners — review routing.
# GitHub requests review from the owner(s) of any path a pull request touches.
# Replace the placeholder teams/handles with real ones once the org is set up.
#
# Syntax: <path pattern>   <@owner> [<@owner> ...]

# Default owner for everything not matched below.
*                       @WMOOP/maintainers

# The meta-model and the canonical schema format are the most load-bearing parts:
# changes here need core-maintainer review (see the RFC process in GOVERNANCE.md).
/docs/02-meta-model.md      @WMOOP/core-maintainers
/docs/03-architecture.md    @WMOOP/core-maintainers
/PATTERNS.md                @WMOOP/core-maintainers

# Governance, ethics and policy documents.
/GOVERNANCE.md          @WMOOP/core-maintainers
/ETHICS.md              @WMOOP/core-maintainers
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md     @WMOOP/core-maintainers
/SECURITY.md            @WMOOP/core-maintainers

# Domain models are owned by their domain stewards (the "Adopt a Domain" program).
# Add one line per domain as stewards are assigned, e.g.:
# /model/nature/        @WMOOP/steward-nature
# /model/transport/     @WMOOP/steward-transport
# /model/geography/     @WMOOP/steward-geography
/model/                 @WMOOP/maintainers
